0..77 Comment "// The checker refuses the laws of a category with families for now. The cell"
78..155 Comment "// layer carries no index at a sort that the laws rewrite (Huang and Angiuli,"
156..216 Comment "// _Fat cell structures and generalized algebraic theories_,"
217..261 Comment "// doi:10.4230/LIPIcs.LICS.2026.58, § 1.1)."
262..264 Comment "//"
265..342 Comment "// The category laws rewrite substitutions, a type moves along a substitution"
343..419 Comment "// and comprehension takes a type. So every sort of the CwF is flexible, and"
420..470 Comment "// the rule reading carries none of their indices."
471..473 Comment "//"
474..549 Comment "// Without the indices two laws part where the sorting joins them. A law on"
550..622 Comment "// terms relates two sides whose sorts agree only modulo a law on types."
623..625 Comment "//"
626..641 Comment "// - see: #5016"
